--- !u!114 &26347198
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 26347192}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7fe7eb0e323ef944696569e0e0436225, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  blockedDialogue:
    npcName: Mrs. Flambe
    sentences:
    - Oh no, oh no... if you don't get a cake done in time, the bakery's finished!
    - The inspector is coming soon and if that cake isn't done...
    - A cake, a real showstopper, that could bring everyone back and impress that
      inspector!
    - Two birds with one stone!!
    - Layers of cream, frosting so smooth it shines... yes, yes, that's it! Just
      one perfect cake to save us all.
    - Mmmm... wanna hear a joke?
    - Why did the cake go to therapy?
    - Because it felt crumby inside!!!
    - Hahaha... Gets me everytime! But anyway, I'm getting distracted.
    - Head downstairs and get started! Put your heart and soul into this cake!
    - I'm counting on you!
  mainDialogue:
    npcName: Mrs. Flambe
    sentences:
    - Wow!!! Absolutely amazing!
    - I can't believe it! You saved the bakery!
    - Thank you! Thank you so very much!!!
  cakeZone: {fileID: 569142182}
  triggersCelebration: 0
  linkedDoor: {fileID: 1572167433}
